<section id="byte-lab" class="byte-lab" aria-labelledby="byte-lab-title"><p class="section-number">INTERACTIVE / THE BYTE LAB</p><h2 id="byte-lab-title">See the same value<br>from both sides.</h2><p>Edit a 32-bit hexadecimal value. The rows below show the actual byte sequence from the lowest address to the highest.</p><div class="lab"><div class="lab-top"><label for="hex-input">UNSIGNED 32-BIT VALUE</label><span>LIVE / INTERACTIVE</span></div><div class="hex-field"><span>0x</span><input id="hex-input" aria-describedby="hex-help hex-error" value="12345678" maxlength="10" inputmode="text" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="characters" autocomplete="off"><button id="reset-value" title="Reset value" aria-label="Reset value to 12345678">↺</button></div><p id="hex-help">1–8 hex digits. An optional 0x prefix is accepted.</p><p id="hex-error" role="alert" hidden>Use 1–8 hexadecimal digits (0–9, A–F).</p><div class="lab-address"><span>ADDRESS</span><span>+0</span><span>+1</span><span>+2</span><span>+3</span></div><div class="lab-row"><span>BIG<span class="lab-endian">-ENDIAN</span></span><output id="big-bytes" aria-live="polite"></output></div><div class="lab-row"><span>LITTLE<span class="lab-endian">-ENDIAN</span></span><output id="little-bytes" aria-live="polite"></output></div><div class="lab-explainer"><span>DECIMAL VALUE</span><output id="decimal-value"></output></div><p class="lab-result" id="lab-result"></p></div></section>
